# headwear/cloth/cap: the Cap (OUTER, P2b wave 2): a soft cloth cap (the herald's, the clerk's, the townsman's), its full crown
# flopping over to the right, a lit headband over the brow; the fringe and the hair below the band show. Hair mask: the
# crown covers the hair's top rows (14-17 px); volume styles draw capped. Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body adult
role headwear cap
layer headwear
anchor head
keys hatpose
legend Q head 0
legend R head 1
legend S head 2
legend T head 3
legend U head 4

